<Window Background="#0A0A0A" 
        Foreground="#EDEDED" 
        Height="450" 
        Title="Mercurio POS" 
        Width="800" 
        x:Class="Mercurio.WPF.MainWindow" 
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation" 
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

    <!-- El DataContext se inyecta desde App.xaml.cs -->
    <Grid Margin="20">
        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

        <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,20" Orientation="Horizontal">
            <TextBox Background="#1A1A1A" BorderBrush="#333" Foreground="White" Margin="0,0,10,0" Padding="5" Text="{Binding NuevoNombre, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}" Width="200"/>

            <TextBox Background="#1A1A1A" BorderBrush="#333" Foreground="White" Margin="0,0,10,0" Padding="5" Text="{Binding NuevoPrecio, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}" Width="100"/>

            <Button Background="#0070F3" BorderThickness="0" Command="{Binding GuardarProductoCommand}" Content="Agregar" Foreground="White" Padding="5" Width="100"/>

            <Button Background="#333" BorderThickness="0" Command="{Binding CargarProductosCommand}" Content="Refrescar" Foreground="White" Margin="10,0,0,0" Padding="5" Width="100"/>
        </StackPanel>

        <!-- Se cambió Foreground a White y se mejoraron los bordes de la grilla -->
        <DataGrid AutoGenerateColumns="True" 
                  Background="#111111" 
                  Foreground="White" 
                  Grid.Row="1" 
                  HeadersVisibility="Column" 
                  ItemsSource="{Binding Productos}" 
                  RowBackground="#1A1A1A"
                  BorderBrush="#333"
                  GridLinesVisibility="Horizontal"
                  HorizontalGridLinesBrush="#222">

            <!-- Estilo para asegurar que las cabeceras de las columnas coincidan con el tema oscuro -->
            <DataGrid.ColumnHeaderStyle>
                <Style TargetType="DataGridColumnHeader">
                    <Setter Property="Background" Value="#1A1A1A"/>
                    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#888888"/>
                    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="10,5"/>
                    <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#333"/>
                    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0,0,0,1"/>
                </Style>
            </DataGrid.ColumnHeaderStyle>
        </DataGrid>
    </Grid>
</Window>
